    "summary": "Bearer: a **LEGIONES DAEMONICA NURGLE** model.\n\n**Aura (6\")**: whenever an enemy unit in range, other than a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit, fails its [Battle-shock test](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock), you can have the bearer use this Enhancement. If so, one model of that unit, picked by its controlling player, is destroyed. Whenever the bearer uses it, the [Daemonic Terror](vsdata:ability/chaos-daemons.the-shadow-of-chaos) rule of your army deals no [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds).",
